; Differential reflectivity, ZDR (dB) — authored for this project against
; the conventional -8..+8 dB NWS-style dual-pol display range (matching
; compute::grid's ZDR requantisation range, ADR-0020). Not sourced from a
; specific published GRLevelX palette — see ADR-0021's verification note.
; Blue (negative, vertically-oriented/hail) through white (near 0, spherical
; drops) to red/orange (positive, large oblate raindrops).
